\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 18. The Core Design Philosophy for Your AI\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Give your AI this exact principle:\

\f0\b Build a modern digital marketplace wrapped in a sophisticated macOS Terminal visual language. The terminal aesthetic is the brand identity, not a gimmick. The application must remain intuitive, responsive and accessible. Users should never be forced to type commands to perform normal actions. Use terminal-inspired prompts, monospace typography, command-style labels, status indicators, tables, ASCII-inspired branding, macOS traffic-light headers, subtle cursor animations and dark technical panels. Keep the visual system minimal, premium and consistent across every page.
\f2\b0 \
And one more very important instruction:\

\f0\b Do not redesign the payment architecture while implementing the UI. The UI is only the presentation layer. Payment state comes from the backend/Firestore, and payment success must never be inferred from React redirects, client-side state or the NOWPayments success URL.
\f2\b0 \
That gives your AI a very clear separation:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 \
                 FRONTEND\
        
